Dear {{recipientName}},

Following your application and verification of your academic credentials, HI-TECH College is pleased to offer you provisional admission into the {{programme}} programme at {{campusName}}.

Registration Number: {{registrationNumber}}
Reporting Date: {{reportingDate}}
Tuition Fee Deposit Required: {{feeDeposit}}

You are required to present your original national identification document and academic certificates during physical registration at the Academic Registry.

Congratulations on your admission to HI-TECH College.

TO WHOM IT MAY CONCERN

This is to certify that {{recipientName}} (Admission No: {{registrationNumber}}) is a bona fide student of HI-TECH College pursuing {{programme}}.

Academic Standing: {{academicStanding}}
Cumulative Mean Grade: {{meanGrade}}
Completed Units Verified: {{unitsCompleted}}

Any alteration renders this document invalid. Authenticity may be confirmed online via the HI-TECH College QR verification portal.

Dear {{recipientName}},

Further to your successful interview, HI-TECH College appoints you to the position of {{positionTitle}} in the {{departmentName}}, effective {{startDate}}.

Employee Number: {{employeeNumber}}
Duty Station: {{campusName}}
Contract Term: {{contractTerm}}

This appointment is governed by the HI-TECH College Human Resources Policy Manual and requires your signed acceptance within seven (7) working days.

